# FieldKit configuration
#
# FieldKit needs no configuration to run. It talks to a simulated office
# server that lives inside the app, and stores everything on the device.
#
# Copy this to `.env.local` only if you want to change the defaults below.
# `.env*` is git-ignored apart from this template.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Demo data
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The PRNG seed used to generate the day's jobs. Same seed in, same jobs out —
# which is what makes the tests and the screenshots reproducible.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SEED=20261027

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# There is no API key, no backend URL and no analytics key, because there is
# no real backend. If this app were pointed at one, the base URL would belong
# here as EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL and the token would NOT — a token in an
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ variable is embedded in the shipped bundle and readable by
# anyone who downloads the app.
